 200 words, longer only when there is a lot of text to place.\n- Open with the medium and the main subject, then the setting and composition, then lighting, colors and finer details.\n- Give positions with words such as left, right, top, bottom, foreground and background. No coordinates, lists, headings, JSON or Markdown.\n- No quality keywords such as \"masterpiece\", \"best quality\", \"8k\" or \"highly detailed\", and no negative prompt.\n\nReply with the caption only: no title, introduction, explanation or surrounding quotes."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 21, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Text (System prompt)", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.41.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 1}, {"showAdvanced": false, "outputs": [{"name": "CLIP", "slot_index": 0, "links": [42, 50, 72], "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "CLIP"}], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["qwen3.5_9b_w4a8_gptq.safetensors", "moss_image", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "clip_name"}, "name": "clip_name", "label": "clip_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "clip_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "type"}, "name": "type", "label": "type", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "type"}, {"widget": {"name": "device"}, "shape": 7, "name": "device", "label": "device", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "device"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CLIPLoader", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [350, 140], "pos": [658.2080688476562, 3.4221396446228027], "id": 25, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "models": [{"directory_invalid": true, "name": "qwen3.5_9b_w4a8_gptq.safetensors", "directory": "text_encoders", "url": "https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/resolve/main/te